# Quest for Ancient Secrets: "Whenever a card is put into your graveyard from anywhere". Bot1 casts Lingering Souls: the
# spell lands in its graveyard from the stack, one counter (accepted). Bot2's Cut Down destroys one of the two Spirit
# tokens; a token is no card (CR 111.7), so it puts nothing into the graveyard that Quest counts, and Bot1 is asked
# nothing (the refusal). Then Bot2's Duress makes Bot1 discard Dark Ritual: a card from a hand, a second counter. Bot2's
# own Cut Down and Duress go to Bot2's graveyard and count for nothing. Two counters: a token counted would make three.

[Bot1 Deck]
Island
Plains
Mox Sapphire
Mox Pearl
Quest for Ancient Secrets
Lingering Souls
Dark Ritual
Island x20

[Bot2 Deck]
Swamp
Swamp
Cut Down
Duress
Swamp x3
Swamp x20

